        "slc_3d5d8c30113bd11120a0d6799a599799077202605daf8f647c678544e6e596c1"
      ],
      "text": "Forgeo is described as a software factory for a coding agent: given a backlog and an agent CLI, it picks the next runnable task, runs the agent, commits the result, and tracks progress in plain files plus a web dashboard."
    },
