        "slc_1c0957c8a7965972be3fec8a9388675ab4c55ad75a5bb5d2dceea91a34671c93"
      ],
      "text": "Task selection picks the oldest OPEN task whose dependencies are all COMPLETED (or whose run_at schedule is due); REVIEW blocks dependants while independent tasks keep running."
    },
