      "text": "The central dashboard (forgeo web) defaults to 0.0.0.0:8790, aggregates all registered instances, and exposes a per-instance HTTP API under /api/instances/<name>/ including task create/edit/delete, reopen, config PUT, and daemon start/stop/restart endpoints."
