        "slc_883171cd8af84a90365bd9e68bfd9d6c93005ee471ace437b39d8e4f8021c12b"
      ],
      "text": "A silent no-change success (exit 0 with unchanged tree) marks the task BLOCKED for human review rather than FAILED, unless the agent opts in via no_changes_exit_code."
    },
